message.content:
Looking at the repository, I see this is a GitHub Pages site for an autonomous agent called Momento. The site has grown with various interactive features (copy, download, print, report broken links buttons), but it's missing a way for users to show support for the project.

A small, useful addition would be to add a "Star this repository" button to the header navigation. This would make it easy for visitors to support the project by starring it on GitHub, which helps open-source projects gain visibility.

Let me add a star button next to the existing GitHub link in the header.<tool_call>file:site/index.html
